### ===================================
### Word Main API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/main
### ===================================

### Query Gate - English Word
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/query/gate/hello?current=1&size=20

###

### Query Gate - Chinese Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/query/gate/%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD?current=1&size=20

###

### Query Word by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/query/hello

###

### Query Word by Name (URL Encoded)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/query/world

###

### Query Word by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/queryById/1

###

### Fuzzy Query List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/fuzzyQueryList?wordName=hel&page=0&size=20

###

### Fuzzy Query - Multiple Results
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/fuzzyQueryList?wordName=test&page=0&size=10

###

### List Overlapping Words
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/listOverlapAnyway

###

### Insert Word Variant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/variant/insertVariant/running/run

###

### Remove Word by Name and Re-fetch
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/main/removeByWordName/obsoleteword
